webpki-roots 1.0.11 contains Mozilla's public CA trust data, used by the pinned
agentOS Rust client's HTTPS transport. It is distributed under CDLA-Permissive-2.0;
the accompanying licence text is CDLA-Permissive-2.0.txt. This data dependency is
not relicensed under the aggregate's FSL licence.
Source: https://crates.io/crates/webpki-roots/1.0.11
